sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Designer
    participant FE as Frontend Recommendation Page
    participant API as Backend API
    participant RS as Recommendation Logic

    U->>FE: Enter or pick HEX color
    FE->>API: GET /recommend/:color
    API->>RS: normalizeHex(color)
    alt invalid HEX
      RS-->>API: invalid
      API-->>FE: 400 Invalid HEX format
      FE-->>U: Show validation error
    else valid HEX
      RS->>RS: Compare contrast with #FFFFFF and #000000
      RS-->>API: suggestedText, contrast, status
      API-->>FE: 200 Recommendation payload
      FE-->>U: Show WCAG result and preview
    end

